window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"akshan","b":"locke","win":["Skill","Skill","Skill","Skill","Locke","Locke","Skill"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"Heroic Swing completes the kite pattern — swing, poke, disengage — and the lane becomes firmly yours."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Both ultimates land and the free ride ends: Purgatory's 120s execute answers your Comeuppance."},{"when":"1st item","text":"The danger spike — Purgatory binds you where you stand, so the swing never gets you clear. Stay out of execute HP."},{"when":"Late","text":"Even: your slipperiness against his burst. He kills you if he binds you; hold E for Ashen Pursuit, not poke."}],"wants":{"you":["Bait Ashen Pursuit first","Swing angles pre-planned","HP above execute range"],"foe":["Chip you into totem range","Ground you with Purgatory","Flanks that cut your escape"]},"early":"This is your lane through 1-5. The double-hit Q outranges everything he has, so poke him off every last hit and punish any walk-up. Level 3 adds Heroic Swing and the full kite pattern — swing, poke, disengage. Throw Q the moment Ashen Pursuit (10s) is spent; that is his only step-up.","mid":"At 6 the lane resets — Purgatory (120s at rank 1) answers your ult. Its binding zone pins you where you stand, so Heroic Swing stops being an escape: hold E until he has spent R or dashed in with Ashen Pursuit, keep your HP above execute range, and ward the flanks he comes from.","late":"Two items in it's even — your slipperiness against his burst. Soul Ignition costs him health first and heals it back at the end, so Grievous Wounds landed before that window flips extended fights. Fight where your swing has walls, and never burst-check while low.","whys":["Akshan owns level 1 — your Q out-ranges all of his poke, so he pays health for every minion he wants.","Level 2 stays yours: the double-hit Q keeps him at bay while your passive shield eats his trade attempts.","Level 3 is yours outright — Heroic Swing lets you kite in and out and he has no way to pin you down.","Levels 4-5 continue the bully phase: swing-and-poke out-trades him every time he shows for a last hit.","Level 6 evens the lane as both ultimates come online — Purgatory's execute now answers your Comeuppance pressure.","First item is Locke's: Purgatory binds you where you stand and executes before Heroic Swing gets you clear. Keep HP high, E in reserve.","Late settles even — your slipperiness against his burst. He kills you if he lands Purgatory, and he rarely does if you space its 1000 range."]});
